{"source": "help_center", "results": [{"id": "cancellations#after-the-order-ships", "title": "Cancelling an order › After the order ships", "text": "Once the order has shipped, it cannot be cancelled. You have two options:
- Refuse the delivery when the courier arrives. The shipment comes back to us;
  we inspect it within 2 days of its arrival and then send the refund.
- Accept the delivery and start a return within the return window (see
  "Returning an item").", "effective_date": "2026-10-01"}], "note": "Cite results as [kb:<id>]. If none answer the question, say so."}
